  "description": "Goddesses, Witches, and Humans. In a chaotic world where the delicate balance between these three existences has collapsed, horrific monsters known as \"Dooms\" now run rampant.\n\nAmos Taylor, a contractor who inherited the powers of a witch, visits a certain village to fulfill the dying wish of the master who raised him to be a knight. There, he meets Evelyn Dale, a young girl possessing the unique ability to visually distinguish between disguised Dooms and ordinary humans.\n\nJoined by Blade Worker, a veteran knight dedicated to fighting the monstrous threat, Amos and Evelyn embark on a perilous journey to gather scattered holy relics. In a dark world swirling with betrayal, death, and conspiracy, they must eradicate the Dooms and restore the world's lost equilibrium.\n\n\"Won't you come on an adventure with us?\"\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/title/S163574)",
